- Carry a cell phone for emergencies (note that service is often unreliable in the western parts of the park).

- Hikers yield to horses. Step calmly off the trail to the downhill side. When approaching from behind, announce yourself and your direction. Avoid sudden movements or loud noises.

- Dial 911 in an emergency.

